  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large bowl, mix together flour, sugar, and cold butter until crumbly.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together maple syrup, eggs, and vanilla extract.",
    "Add the wet ingredients to the dry ingredients and mix until a dough forms.",
    "Press the dough into a 9x9-inch baking dish.",
    "Top with fresh berries.",
